        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken during the 850 km transit from Suchitra to major hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">During the long‑haul journey, Shree Ashirwad employs GPS‑enabled multi‑axle trucks, real‑time route monitoring, and scheduled check‑post clearances. Vehicles are equipped with hydraulic ramps, anti‑theft locks, and climate‑controlled compartments for sensitive items. Drivers follow a strict rest‑and‑inspection schedule to maintain cargo integrity throughout the transit.</p>
